sages, Bug fixed.  -Alteration- Swapped commands for 'swapping weapnos' between weapon #1 and weapon #1.  It was 'X' I changed it to 'M' for move weapons; the 'X' was confusing as that is the command to quit Slycrel.  (it bugged me) *Don't forget to change ANSI menu!*Date Unknown	-Release-Released 'Slycrel dev v2.00'  Uploaded to Olympus BBS and the Twilight Zone BBS.Known Bugs & Work-Arounds for them: (ее=important, еее=fix NOW, *=Solved, ?=not sure)	These are bugs that I'm aware of, and I'm only pulling them off of the top of my head so I'm most likely going to miss quite a few. *?ее	Can occasionally cause a 'bus error' when quitting hermes.  I believe it only does this if slycrel is both the first external to be loaded and if it's ran.  I'm pretty sure this is a privates or a prefs memory management error... will be fixing soon. е	There  is a duplicate player in the player list (viewable in the Arena), what's up w/ that?  Well... I know the origin of this bug also (kinda).  The problem arises when there are the errors in the daily upkeep & there are gladiator combat challenges to resolve; the problem can also arise when a user fights another character in the arena, after the user quits slycrel it seems to dissapear and go back to how it should. *?ее	Incompatible with External Man(ager). *??ее	Crashes a powercomputing 120 when sysop clicks on menu bar, don't have all details yet.